msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Hmm... Nope, I still don't see anything \"off\" about any\r\n"
"of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Do you have a minute?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you... So, did you find proof of Akechi's\r\n"
"innocence yet? Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "What was that you were looking at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Oh, this? This is the list of evidence we made during the\r\n"
"investigation six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"You're taking such a hard look at this case, I thought I'd\r\n"
"better take another glance myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Can I see that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I guess, but you won't find anything wrong with any of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"I honestly can't figure out why you think Akechi is\r\n"
"innocent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>List of Evidence<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "...Wait a minute! What's this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "What's what?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "296"
msgid "I finally got it. Was it really this simple all along?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "No mistake about it. Somebody framed Akechi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "What? Are you serious?"
msgstr "Cosa? Ma dici sul serio?"

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'll explain everything, but first, I need you to\r\n"
"round up everybody related to the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "But...!"
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "356"
msgid "It'll turn out fine. You'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Okay... Just don't blame me if it doesn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I'll get everybody together at Café Alps. That ought to\r\n"
"work, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Yeah, that's fine."
msgstr "Sì, va bene."

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"(I've got all the evidence I need. It's time to reveal what\r\n"
"really happened six years ago.)"
msgstr ""

